{'symbol': 'CVX', 'date': '2023-01-27 06:45:00', 'title': 'CHEVRON ANNOUNCES FOURTH QUARTER RESULTS', 'text': 'SAN RAMON, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--CHEVRON CORPORATION (NYSE: CVX) TODAY REPORTED EARNINGS OF $6.4 BILLION ($3.33 PER SHARE - DILUTED) FOR FOURTH QUARTER 2022, COMPARED WITH $5.1 BILLION ($2.63 PER SHARE - DILUTED) IN FOURTH QUARTER 2021. INCLUDED IN THE CURRENT QUARTER WERE $1.1 BILLION OF INTERNATIONAL UPSTREAM WRITE-OFF AND IMPAIRMENT CHARGES, AND PENSION SETTLEMENT COSTS OF $17 MILLION. FOREIGN CURRENCY EFFECTS DECREASED EARNINGS BY $405 MILLION. ADJUSTED EARNINGS OF $7.9 BILLION ($4.09 PER SHARE - DILUTED) IN FOURTH QUARTER 2022 COMPARED TO ADJUSTED EARNINGS OF $4.9 BILLION ($2.56 PER SHARE - DILUTED) IN FOURTH QUARTER 2021.'}